    "image": "Use case: identity-preserve. Intentional clean cut from the preceding medium shot to a tight eye-level close-up of Dariusz in the same warm Klub Fantastyki lighting. Exact face, black rectangular glasses, reddish braided beard, blue shirt, dark vest and leather straps. He looks slightly down toward the K20 below frame, about to speak, with restrained disbelief. No extra people, text or watermark.",
